["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">満</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>充满；满足；满；足够；满（达到容量上限）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マン・バン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">み.ちる・み.つ・み.たす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不満</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふまん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不满；不满意；不悦；怨言；不快</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">満足</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まんぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">满足；满意；满意感；充分；充足；恰当；得当；满足（方程式）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">満ちる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みちる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">充满；填满；洋溢；（月亮）盈；圆；（潮水）上涨；涌入；（期限）届满；到期；成熟</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">敗</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>失败；败北；腐败</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やぶ.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">失敗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しっぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">失败；错误；失误</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">勝敗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうはい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">胜负；（比赛、战斗等的）结果</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一敗</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いっぱい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">一次失败；一场败仗</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">値</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>价格；价值；成本</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ね・あたい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">価値</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">价值；优点</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">値</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">价格；价钱；成本；价值；价值；优点；值；数值</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">値する</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたいする</span><span class=\"k-wz\">值得；配得上；堪当</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">突</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>刺；撞；突出；突然；戳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トツ・カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">衝突</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうとつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">碰撞；撞击；冲击；相撞；冲突；小冲突；争执；不和；口角；摩擦</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">突然</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とつぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">突然；陡然；意外</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">煙突</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんとつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">烟囱；烟筒；（船的）烟囱；炉管；不打表载客</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">光</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>光；光线</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひか.る・ひかり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">光</span><span class=