s=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">客</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">客人；访客；顾客；客户；观众；游客；乘客；（招待客人用的）容器的量词</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">観客</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんきゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">观众；听众</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗客</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうきゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乘客；旅客</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">否</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>否定；拒绝；否认；不；反对</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いな・いや</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">否</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いな</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不；不是；异议；反对；不同意</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">否定</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">否定；否认；推翻；不承认；（逻辑）否定；（计算机）非运算</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">拒否</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょひ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拒绝；否决；回绝</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">師</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>老师；专家；军队；榜样；大师</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いくさ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">医師</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">医生；医师</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">技師</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工程师；技术员</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">教師</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">教师；讲师</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">登</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>攀登；上升；登记；出场</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ・ト・ドウ・ショウ・チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のぼ.る・あ.がる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">登る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のぼる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">登上；攀登；上去；（日月等）升起；上升；上京；进京；晋升；升职；达到；总计；（价格）上涨；溯流而上；逆流航行；被提上议程</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">登山</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とざん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">登山；登峰；攀登山峰</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">登場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（舞台上的）登场；（书籍、电影等中的）出现；出现；登场；涌现；推出；问世</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">易</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>容易；简单；交换；贸易；占卜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エキ・イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やさ.しい・やす.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">易しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やさしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">容易；简单；平易</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貿易</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうえき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（对外）贸易；国际贸易；进出口贸易</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">容易</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">容易；简单；轻易</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">速</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>快速；迅速；加速；提早</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はや.い・はや-・はや.める・すみ.やか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">速い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はやい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">快；迅速；敏捷；高速；早；尽早；比平时更早；过早；为时尚早；容易；简单；快捷；一…就…；刚…就…；瞬间…</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">急速</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうそく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迅速；快速</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高速</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうそく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高速；快速；急速；高速公路；快速路；高速干道</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">存</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>存在；认为；保存；觉察；询问</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソン・ゾン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ながら.える・あ.る・たも.つ・と.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">ご存じ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ごぞんじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">了解；知道；熟人；相识的人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">存在</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そんざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">存在；实在；存有</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">保存</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほぞん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">保存；保留；储存；维护；（计算机）保存文件；存盘</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">飛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>飞；跳过（页）；散开</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.ぶ・と.ばす・-と.ばす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飛ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">飞；翱翔；跳跃；跳起；弹起；蹦跳；飞溅；散落；溅射；飞出；匆忙；急速；逃离；逃脱；逃走；消失；消散；褪去；稀疏；断裂；脱落；掉落；烧断；发出；流传；扩散；飞来；击来；缺失；遗漏；跳过；中断</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飛行機</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひこうき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">飞机；航空器</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飛行場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひこうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">飞行场；机场；航空港</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">殺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>杀；杀害；屠杀；削减；切下</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ・サイ・セツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ころ.す・-ごろ.し・そ.ぐ・あや.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">殺す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ころす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">杀死；杀害；谋杀；屠杀；压制；阻断；妨碍；埋没（才能）；消除（气味）；损害（风味）；降低（速度）；压抑（声音、情感等）；忍住；憋住（哈欠、笑声等）；屏住（呼吸）；使（跑垒者）出局；典当；抵押</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自殺</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自杀</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗殺</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あんさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">暗杀</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">号</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>称号；编号；名称；别名；呼喊</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゴウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さけ.ぶ・よびな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">番号</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばんごう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">号码；数字序列</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">信号</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんごう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">信号；发信号；红绿灯；交通信号灯</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">記号</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きごう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">符号；记号；标志</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">単</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>单一；简单；仅；单层</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひとえ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">簡単</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんたん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">简单；容易；不复杂；简短；简略；简便</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">単位</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">单位（如米、克等）；计量单位；单位（由多个部分组成的整体）；群体；整体；学分；（学业）积分；按…；以…为单位；每…</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">単語</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">单词；词汇</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">座</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>坐；座位；集会；剧团；星座</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すわ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">座る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">坐；就坐；跪坐；就任；担任；占据（职位）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">座席</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざせき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">座位（尤指公共场所或有指定座位的地方）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">座敷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">榻榻米房间；日式正式房间；在榻榻米房间举办的宴席（尤指有艺妓或舞妓出席的场合）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">破</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>破坏；打破；击败；撕裂；挫败</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やぶ.る・やぶ.れる・わ.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破産</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破产；无偿债能力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やぶる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">撕裂；撕破；破坏；冲破；突破；击穿；击败；战胜；打破；破坏；扰乱；破坏；毁坏；违反；违背；背弃；侵犯；破纪录；刷新纪录</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破片</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はへん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">碎片；破片；碎屑；残片</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">除</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>除去；排除；取消；废除；除法（数学运算）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョ・ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のぞ.く・-よ.け</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">掃除</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">清扫；打扫；擦拭；刷洗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">除く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">除去；消除；去掉；清除；排除；除外；略去；剔除；除掉；消灭；诛杀</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">削除</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さくじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">删除；消除；擦除；划去</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">完</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>完成；结束；完美</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完成</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；完善；成就</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完全</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完美；完全；完整</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完了</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；结束；完成时；完成式</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">降</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>下降；降落；降下；投降；降伏</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・ゴ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.りる・お.ろす・ふ.る・ふ.り・くだ.る・くだ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（雨、雪、灰等）降落；下落；（霜）降；（霜）结；（阳光、月光）照射；倾泻；（幸运、不幸等）降临；来临；到来</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降りる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おりる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">下降；下来；降下；下车；下船；下马；离开；下台；退职；放弃；退出；认输；获得；颁发；给予；形成；凝结（霜、露、雾等）；排出；排泄（蛔虫等寄生虫）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">降り出す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふりだす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">开始下雨；开始下雪</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">責</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p 