lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あぶ.ない・あや.うい・あや.ぶむ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危ない</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あぶない</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险的；有风险的；危急的；险峻的；不稳妥的；处于危险中；危在旦夕；情况严重的；岌岌可危的；不确定的；不可靠的；无把握的；不稳定的；靠不住的；千钧一发的；侥幸的；勉强的；可疑的；不正当的；不正经的；小心！当心！注意！危险！</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危険</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险；危难；危害；风险；危险</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">危うい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あやうい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">危险的；处于危险中；面临迫在眉睫的危险；危殆的（局势）；岌岌可危的（状态、平衡等）；悬而未决的；受到威胁的；不稳定的；不可靠的；令人担忧的；令人忧虑的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">苦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>痛苦；苦难；苦恼；苦涩；苦味</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くる.しい・-ぐる.しい・くる.しむ・くる.しめる・にが.い・にが.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">苦的；苦味的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦痛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くつう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">痛苦；苦楚；折磨；痛楚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">苦労</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くろう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">劳苦；辛苦；困难；辛劳；忧虑；担心；焦虑；挂虑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">迎</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>迎接；欢迎；会见</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゲイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</