\" lang=\"ja\">競馬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赛马；赛马运动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">愛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>爱；喜爱；疼爱；珍爱；爱慕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">アイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いと.しい・かな.しい・め.でる・お.しむ・まな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爱；喜爱；关怀；（佛教）爱欲；贪爱；执著；（基督教）圣爱；神爱；阿加佩；爱尔兰</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛情</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爱情；爱；感情</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愛する</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あいする</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爱；热爱；喜爱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">富</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>富裕；丰富；使富裕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フ・フウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.む・とみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">豊富</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">丰富；充裕；富有；充分</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">富</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">财富；财富；资产；资源；彩票</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">富む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">富有；充满；充足；丰富；富裕；富有</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">彼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-